# Ignore every file type by default while allowing directory traversal.
*
!*/

# Keep the allowlist itself.
!/.gitignore

# File types present when this repository was initialized.
!*.cpp
!*.cs
!*.h
!*.ini
!*.uplugin
!*.uproject

# Unreal build products, including plugin-local intermediates.
**/Intermediate/
Saved/

# LoadingScreen is vendored so its complete source and resources are retained.
!Plugins/LoadingScreen/
!Plugins/LoadingScreen/**
Plugins/LoadingScreen/Binaries/
Plugins/LoadingScreen/Intermediate/
